  "recordSet": [],
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "GR1_robot",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tGR1 Robot Teleoperation Dataset\n\t\n\nA large-scale humanoid robot teleoperation dataset collected using the Fourier GR-1 (GR1T1) robot, part of the GR00T robotics initiative.\nThis is a true subset of nvidia/PhysicalAI-Robotics-GR00T-Teleop-GR1.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\n\nEpisodes: 22,209\nTotal frames: 6,362,293\nTotal tasks: 46,669\nVideos: 22,209\nFrequency: 20 FPS\nRobot: GR1T1 (Fourier GR-1 humanoid)\n\nThe dataset contains egocentric video observations (1280x800) paired with full-body\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/Physis-AI/GR1_robot.",
  "alternateName": [
    "Physis-AI/GR1_robot",
    "GR1 Robot Teleoperation Dataset"
  ],
